OL,3,APolice chief says racists and
OL,4,Amisogynists working inside force
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief of Wales' largest police
OL,7,Fforce says he is working to root out
OL,8,Fracists and misogynists from his
OL,9,Forganisation as part of efforts to
OL,10,Fimprove trust in officers.
OL,12,FChief Constable Jeremy Vaughan had
OL,13,Fresponded to a question from MPs about
OL,14,Fhow he and other police chiefs were
OL,15,Fclamping down on staff misconduct "in a
OL,16,Fpost-Sarah Everard era".
OL,18,FThe South Wales Police chief said: "Do
OL,19,FI think I've got racists, misogynists,
OL,20,Fworking for me? Yes. Do I think my work
OL,21,Fis to find them and excommunicate them
OL,22,Ffrom policing? Absolutely yes."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
